# Logs Directory

This directory contains auto-generated Markdown logs for every email processed by the AI Email Auto Responder.

## Log Format

Each log file is named:
`YYYY-MM-DD_HH-MM-SS_{sender_email}.md`

## Contents

Each log includes:
- Email metadata (sender, subject, category, urgency)
- AI-generated summary
- Draft reply
- Approval status
- Extracted tasks
- Memory storage confirmation

Logs are automatically generated by the n8n **Write File** node.
